<view class="loading-panel" wx:if="{{loading}}"><view class="loading-dot"></view><text>正在检查备份权益…</text></view>
<view class="backup-page page-shell" wx:else>
  <view class="backup-hero surface-card"><text class="backup-eyebrow">为这份家谱留一份完整备份</text><text class="backup-title">{{family.name}}</text><text class="backup-copy">备份完成后，可保存到微信聊天，需要时再取用。</text><view class="backup-includes"><view><text class="include-mark">人</text><text>人物与关系</text></view><view><text class="include-mark">图</text><text>家庭照片</text></view><view><text class="include-mark">记</text><text>变更记录</text></view></view><view class="backup-rules"><text>仅管理员</text><text>每 7 天一次</text><text>72 小时内领取</text></view></view>
  <view class="permission-tip" wx:if="{{!isAdmin}}">你不是这份家谱的管理员，可请管理员生成并转发备份。</view>
  <view class="upgrade-card" wx:elif="{{!membershipActive}}" bindtap="openMembership"><text>完整备份是家庭会员权益</text><text>升级后由管理员生成，全体家人可在聊天中保存多个备份文件。去开通 ›</text></view>
  <button class="primary-button create-button" wx:elif="{{!task || task.status === 'failed' || task.status === 'expired'}}" loading="{{creating}}" disabled="{{creating}}" bindtap="createBackup">生成完整家庭备份</button>
  <view class="task-card surface-card" wx:if="{{task}}"><view class="task-heading"><text>{{task.status === 'completed' ? '备份已生成' : task.status === 'failed' ? '生成失败' : task.status === 'expired' ? '领取已过期' : '正在生成备份'}}</text><text>{{task.progress}}%</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-value" style="width:{{task.progress}}%"></view></view><text class="task-note" wx:if="{{task.unavailableMediaCount}}">有 {{task.unavailableMediaCount}} 张照片暂未包含，其他家谱资料不受影响。</text><text class="task-note error" wx:if="{{task.failureMessage}}">{{task.failureMessage}}</text><view class="part-row" wx:for="{{parts}}" wx:key="index"><view><text>{{item.displayName}}</text><text>{{item.sizeText}}</text></view><button class="secondary-button" data-index="{{item.index}}" loading="{{downloadingPartIndex === item.index || sharingPartIndex === item.index}}" disabled="{{downloadingPartIndex >= 0 || sharingPartIndex >= 0}}" bindtap="downloadPart">{{downloadingPartIndex === item.index ? '准备中 ' + downloadProgress + '%' : sharingPartIndex === item.index ? '正在转发' : readyPartIndex === item.index ? '转发到聊天' : '准备文件'}}</button></view></view>
  <view class="privacy-note surface-card" bindtap="togglePrivacy"><view class="privacy-heading"><view><text class="privacy-title">隐私保护</text><text class="privacy-summary">备份仅供家谱管理员领取</text></view><text class="privacy-arrow">{{privacyExpanded ? '收起' : '了解详情'}}</text></view><text class="privacy-detail" wx:if="{{privacyExpanded}}">备份只包含家庭成员主动记录的家谱资料和已可正常查看的照片，不包含登录、支付或邀请安全信息。</text></view>
  <button class="text-link" bindtap="openHistory">查看完整变更历史</button>
</view>
